{
 "about": "Burda's face map. OUAK's code shows a face by turning 23 objects on and off (its face component, MainGameOujiFace), one face group per motion row. Burda's new style has a piece for each of the 23 slots, named as the slot, plus her singing eyes. Her old style shows one of 11 cards: her four, and one for each of Forever's face expressions. Forever picks a card per motion from a face expression byte in each motion record (meaning inferred). All mappings here are mine; nobody has seen them in the game.",
